WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.807
Frog: Where can we play?

2
00:00:11.808 --> 00:00:18.410
Squirrel: We can play in the trees.

3
00:00:18.411 --> 00:00:24.544
Raccoon: I can play in the trees!

4
00:00:24.545 --> 00:00:35.352
Frog: Me too.

5
00:00:35.353 --> 00:01:01.952
Turtle: I can't play in the trees.

6
00:01:01.953 --> 00:01:06.872
Raccoon: We can play on the rocks.

7
00:01:06.873 --> 00:01:26.377
Turtle: I can play on the rocks!

8
00:01:26.378 --> 00:01:33.030
Fish: I can't play on the rocks.

9
00:01:33.031 --> 00:01:38.742
Raccoon: Where can we play?

10
00:01:38.743 --> 00:01:44.194
Fish: We can play in the stream.

11
00:01:44.195 --> 00:01:47.978
Frog: I can play in the stream.

12
00:01:47.979 --> 00:01:51.301
Turtle: Me too.

13
00:01:51.302 --> 00:02:05.190
Squirrel: Let's all play in the stream!

